  "finalText": "### Changes Made\n\n1. **`src/csv.mjs`**: Committed any pending in-progress CSV record at end-of-file (`if (recordStarted) endRecord();`) so that rows without a trailing newline (including quoted final fields and trailing empty fields) are preserved without introducing phantom rows when a final newline is present.\n2. **`src/money.mjs`**: Updated `parseMoney` to use exact `BigInt` integer arithmetic over 4-digit fractional subunits (`(subUnits + 50n) / 100n`) before applying the sign, ensuring symmetric round-half-away-from-zero behavior for both invoices and credit notes without IEEE-754 floating-point drift.\n3. **`src/dedupe.mjs`**: Updated `invoiceKey` to return `JSON.stringify([invoice.vendorId, invoice.invoiceId])` (matching `paymentKey`), scoping invoice deduplication, conflict detection, and payment reconciliation collision-safely by vendor.\n\n### Commands Run & Results\n\n- `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (baseline): 38 passed, 6 failed (`actual mixed-feed CLI output`, `CSV EOF is a valid record boundary`, `invoice identity includes vendor`, `rounding at a half cent`, `mixed supplier feed retains the EOF row`, `same invoice number in different suppliers`).\n- `node --test test/*.test.mjs` (after fix): All 44 tests passed (`pass 44`, `fail 0`).\n- `node bin/ledger.mjs import data/invoices.csv --payments data/payments.csv --as-of 2026-03-01 --format json`: Exited 0, importing all 4 source rows (`totalCents: 1208`, `creditCents: -101`), applying all 3 payments (`paidCents: 750`, `outstandingCents: 458`), and producing 0 diagnostics or conflicts.",
